Package: walkability
Title: Urban Walkability and Active Transit Network Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
         person("Paul E.", "Santos Andrade", , 
                "paulefrens@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                 comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))  
Description: High-performance geospatial graph analysis for urban street networks,
    walkability, and active transitability. Features topological diagnostics and
    repair for user-provided networks, automated data acquisition from Overture Maps
    and OpenStreetMap, multi-threaded Rust kernels for isochrone-based reachable network
    length metrics with partial-edge credits, and publication-ready ggplot2 visualizations.
